# Normalize line endings: text files are LF in the repo and in every working
# tree (checkout), regardless of a contributor's core.autocrlf setting. Keeps
# Prettier (endOfLine: lf) and the pre-commit hooks green on Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicit binary markers so a future asset isn't line-ending mangled.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
